		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Blue-purple serpentine being of Limbo. Twist magic to their purposes.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 16, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 bite +3 (1d6) or 1 spell +3, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly, swim), <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 3</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Being of Chaos</strong>. Only damaged by silver or magical sources. Immune to acid.</p><p></p><p><strong>Mimic Form</strong>. As an action, shapechange into humanoid protean has seen recently.</p><p></p><p><strong>Spell Pilfer</strong>. One spellcaster within close, CHA 15+ or lose the ability to cast a random spell, protean can cast spell. Spellcaster regains spell after resting.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
